From: M1892 mainline maintainers <m1892-mainline@invalid.example>
Subject: [PATCH] input: m1892-dw7914: use packaged Qualcomm firmware path

The privacy-clean public image obtains proprietary device firmware only from
the owner's official Flyme package.  That package follows the kernel firmware
layout and installs this payload below qcom/m1892.  Request the same canonical
path from the driver so no duplicate or ad-hoc compatibility copy is needed.

SPDX-License-Identifier: GPL-2.0-only
---
 drivers/input/misc/m1892-dw7914-safe-pulse.c | 2 +-
 1 file changed, 1 insertion(+), 1 deletion(-)

diff --git a/drivers/input/misc/m1892-dw7914-safe-pulse.c b/drivers/input/misc/m1892-dw7914-safe-pulse.c
--- a/drivers/input/misc/m1892-dw7914-safe-pulse.c
+++ b/drivers/input/misc/m1892-dw7914-safe-pulse.c
@@ -49,7 +49,7 @@
 #define DW7914_M1892_FW_SIZE           12288
 #define DW7914_M1892_RAM_CHUNK         1024
 #define DW7914_M1892_FW_FNV1A64        0x7de856ef0fc3b332ULL
-#define DW7914_M1892_FW_NAME           "m1892/dw_172hz.bin"
+#define DW7914_M1892_FW_NAME           "qcom/m1892/dw_172hz.bin"
 
 /* Stock 4.9 calls dw7914_vd_clamp_set(8520), which writes 8520 / 100. */
 #define DW7914_M1892_VD_CLAMP          0x55
-- 
2.39.5
